strong\">Tom </span>: How do I get there?<br> <span class=\"strong\">Concierge</span> : When you are in front of the hotel, turn right. Walk down Pathe Street to Rokin.<br>  <span class=\"strong\">Tom </span>: Rokin Street?<br><span class=\"strong\">Concierge: </span>Yes. The HRH sits in the canal on Rokin Street.<br>", "type": "example"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Ask for Directions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Give Directions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Where?<br>   <br>How do I get there?<br>   <br>Rokin Street?<br></span><br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">How do I get <span class = \\\"strong\\\">to</span>...</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">at </span> Emperor's Canal.<br>   <br>When you are <span class=\\\"strong\\\">in front of</span> the hotel, turn right.<br>  <br><span class=\\\"strong\\\">in</span> the canal <span class=\\\"strong\\\">on</span> Rokin Street<br></span><br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">To get <span class = \\\"strong\\\">to</span> the stadium, turn left</span>.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "cozy", "type": "name"}, {"content": "comfortable and warm", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It's a small cozy dining room with 16 places.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le10ob07aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about a small boat cruise.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "deck", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a floor between the sides of a ship or boat  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You can sit on the deck of the boat and look at the city.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le10ob07aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "private", "type": "name"}, {"content": "not open to the general public ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: He has a private jet to use when he wants.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le10ob07aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to inquire ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to ask about  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Can you inquire about the tour for me?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le10ob07aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "exactly ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "completely accurate  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: This is exactly the trip I want.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le10ob07aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "prince", "type": "name"}, {"content": "son of a king or queen ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: This boat is named after Prince Heinrich.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le10ob07aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"content": "engenn4le10ob07re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Make a plan to go on a boat tour from a hotel.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a dialogue requesting help from the concierge at the hotel. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "He gives you information.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Ask for directions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Practice your dialogue with your partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"content